# Build context for deploy/api.Dockerfile. Anything listed here can never end up inside an image layer.

# Machine-local settings and API keys (DeepSeek) — the single most important line in this file.
**/appsettings.Local.json
**/appsettings.*.local.json

# Uploaded files and local run state
**/App_Data
**/local-logs

# Build output — the image builds its own
**/bin
**/obj
**/.vs
**/*.user

# Not needed to build
scripts
tests
docker-compose.yml
**/*.md
